  "goodToKnow": "Die Garnele is a shrimp or prawn. Confusingly, the famous Nordseekrabben, peeled by hand and eaten in Krabbenbrötchen, are biologically Garnelen, not crabs; true crabs are Krabben or Taschenkrebse. Large prawns are often sold as Riesengarnelen or Gambas. Much shrimp farming abroad is criticised for destroying mangroves. Plural: die Garnelen."
